      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "从第一阶段到现在，你觉得自己最大的变化是什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我现在能用中文处理更多真实生活里的事情。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "比如呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "工作里问问题、安排任务、发消息。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "生活方面呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "会安排休息和运动，也敢自己处理小问题。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "学习中文的方法也变了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，我不再一直找“最好的工具”。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "旅行方面呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我学会了计划不用太满，变化也没关系。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "还有新朋友。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这个可能是我最开心的部分。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "现在你在杭州已经有自己的圈子了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "而且说中文的时候没以前那么怕错了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这很重要。语言是用来交流的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "下一阶段我想说得更完整，也想理解更复杂的内容。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc050_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那就是新的开始。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
